# Raw downloaded audio. Two of the three sources forbid redistributing the
# unmodified file, and a repository is redistribution, so only the converted
# files in web/public/audio/ are committed. The raw files stay here as the
# source for re-converting a sound. See CREDITS.md.
/assets/*.wav
/assets/*.mp3
/assets/*.ogg

# Screenshots and traces written by the Playwright MCP server.
/.playwright-mcp/
